@theory
title: Theorise the Offensive
subtitle: The Left's ideas spread through the party schools.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.lean_offensive += 3;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 4;
!}

Maslow argues that a party which waits for the majority will wait for ever. The young comrades copy his articles out by hand.

@zinoviev
title: Write to Zinoviev and Bukharin
subtitle: Maslow's friends on the Executive hear that the Zentrale is timid.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?][? if comintern_member = 0 : We are not in the International. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and comintern_member = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 5;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', 8);
RG.ecci('bukharin', 5);
Q.independence -= 4;
!}

Maslow's letters to Moscow are long and well informed, and they are written in Russian. The Executive learns that the German Zentrale is timid and the German Left is not.
